{"unit_id":"Enosensu__dsh-fork-relink#card-zh","repo":"Enosensu/dsh-fork-relink","commit":"3311baeded0a4c9048164a4ca72e9655c3366d9d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fork-relink 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话分支插件：在 fork 会话创建时监听 session/created，并通过官方 agents.create 将原会话中已完成的子 agent 历史复制到新分支。它递归复制子 agent 树、登记新子会话目录，并释放副本活体以便后续通过官方恢复路径继续访问；也会跳过没有已完成轮次的子 agent，并尝试修复已有副本的目录登记。适合需要在会话分支后继续查看和使用原有子 agent 的 DSH 用户。无需额外 API key 或外部服务；可用 DSH_HOME 指定本机数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:476-505","lib/index.js:342-395","lib/index.js:429-454"]}
{"unit_id":"Enosensu__dsh-fork-relink#card-en","repo":"Enosensu/dsh-fork-relink","commit":"3311baeded0a4c9048164a4ca72e9655c3366d9d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fork-relink is a DSH web plugin that copies completed subagent histories to a new fork. It recursively copies nested agents, catalogs copies, and leaves them resumable. It skips agents without a completed turn. No API key or external service is required; DSH_HOME sets the local data directory.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:476-505","lib/index.js:342-395","lib/index.js:429-454"]}
